WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.950
Drag the screen to look around,
and tap or click where you'd like to go.

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:11.060
Switch to the floor plan or 3D view
to see the whole room at once,

3
00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:13.600
and use the measure tool
to check dimensions.

4
00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:17.810
To compare rooms, select Other spaces
and enter your guest numbers

5
00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.330
to see which spaces fit.

6
00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.170
When you're ready, select Share
to send this room to your team,

7
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:26.430
or Enquire to start planning
your event with us.
